{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_adr_adr_007_dependency_map_renderer_adr_007", "label": "ADR-007 Sigma.js and graphology for the dependency map renderer", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-007-dependency-map-renderer.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The map must render the impact neighbourhood at 60 fps on a 100k-node estate; SVG and Canvas 2D fall below 60 fps in the low thousands of edges, only WebGL keeps the frame budget."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_007_dependency_map_renderer_sigma_js", "label": "sigma 4.0.3 (MIT) WebGL 2 renderer in DependencyCanvas.tsx", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-007-dependency-map-renderer.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_007_dependency_map_renderer_graphology", "label": "graphology 0.26.0 in-memory graph model (+ graphology-types, graphology-layout)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-007-dependency-map-renderer.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "All four libraries are pure browser code with no network access, so the air-gap profile is unaffected."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_007_dependency_map_renderer_lane_layout_web_worker", "label": "Lane layout runs off the main thread in lane-layout.worker.ts", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-007-dependency-map-renderer.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Graphs smaller than DEPENDENCY_MAP.workerMinNodes are placed synchronously because a worker round trip would cost more than the layout; useLaneLayout discards answers for superseded requests."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_007_dependency_map_renderer_dependency_map_constants", "label": "DEPENDENCY_MAP constants in @openmap/constants hold